## Animations & Micro-interactions

**Every interaction should feel alive.** Animations make the app feel premium and native.

### Timing Standards

| Type | Duration | Easing |
|------|----------|--------|
| Micro (button press) | 100-150ms | `ease-out` |
| Short (card hover) | 150-200ms | `ease-in-out` |
| Medium (modal open) | 200-300ms | `ease-out` |
| Long (page transition) | 300-400ms | `ease-in-out` |

### Button Press Effect

```tsx
// All tappable elements should have press feedback
<Button className="active:scale-[0.97] transition-transform duration-100">

// For cards
<Card className="active:scale-[0.98] transition-transform duration-100">
```

### Progress Bar Animation

```tsx
// Animated fill on value change
<Progress 
  value={percentage} 
  className="h-2 transition-all duration-500 ease-out"
/>

// Celebration pulse at 100%
{percentage >= 100 && (
  <Progress className="animate-pulse bg-green-500" />
)}
```

### Card Entry Animation

```tsx
// Staggered fade-in for lists
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  transition={{ delay: index * 0.05 }}
>
```

### Set Completion Animation

```tsx
// When user completes a set - brief scale + color flash
<div className={cn(
  "transition-all duration-200",
  justCompleted && "scale-105 bg-green-500/20"
)}>
```

### Haptic Feedback (Native Feel)

```tsx
// Trigger haptic on important actions
const triggerHaptic = (type: 'light' | 'medium' | 'success') => {
  if ('vibrate' in navigator) {
    navigator.vibrate(type === 'light' ? 10 : type === 'medium' ? 20 : [10, 50, 10]);
  }
};

// Use on: set completion, workout start, milestone reached
```

