## Typography Scale

| Usage | Classes |
|-------|---------|
| Page titles | `text-xl font-semibold` |
| Section titles | `text-lg font-semibold` |
| Card titles | `text-base font-medium` |
| Body text | `text-sm` (default) |
| Secondary/muted | `text-sm text-muted-foreground` |
| Large stats | `text-2xl font-bold` |

## Touch Targets (Gym-Friendly)

**Minimum sizes for interactive elements:**
- All buttons: `min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px]`
- Action buttons (+/-/✓): 44px circular
- List items: full-width tap target

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Large touch target
<Button className="h-11 w-11 rounded-full p-0">
  <Plus className="h-5 w-5" />
</Button>

// ❌ WRONG - Too small for gym use
<Button size="sm" className="h-8 w-8">
```

## Colors (Semantic Only) - CRITICAL

**NEVER hardcode colors.** This is essential for Phase 2 theme customization.

All UI must use CSS variables so users can customize colors without code changes.

| Purpose | Token |
|---------|-------|
| Page background | `bg-background` |
| Card background | `bg-card` |
| Primary actions | `bg-primary text-primary-foreground` |
| Muted/disabled | `bg-muted text-muted-foreground` |
| Borders | `border-border` |
| Progress (incomplete) | `bg-muted` |
| Progress (complete) | `bg-primary` or `bg-green-600` |
| Delete actions | `variant="destructive"` |

**Training-specific tokens (defined in globals.css):**

```css
--exercise-complete: hsl(142 76% 36%);     /* green for completed */
--exercise-selected-bg: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);
--muscle-badge-bg: hsl(210 100% 95%);      /* light blue */
--muscle-badge-text: hsl(210 100% 40%);
```

## Visual Depth & Shadows

**Modern apps use subtle elevation to create hierarchy.**

### Shadow System

```tsx
// Elevated card (primary content)
className="shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"

// Floating action (FAB, sticky buttons)
className="shadow-lg shadow-primary/25"

// Modal/sheet overlay
className="shadow-2xl"
```

### Card Styling Classes

```tsx
// Standard card - subtle elevation
<Card className="rounded-2xl border-0 bg-card shadow-sm">

// Interactive card - lift on press
<Card className="rounded-2xl border-0 bg-card shadow-sm 
  active:scale-[0.98] active:shadow-none transition-all duration-100">

// Highlighted card (selected/active)
<Card className="rounded-2xl border-2 border-primary bg-primary/5 shadow-md shadow-primary/10">

// Completed card (success state)
<Card className="rounded-2xl border-2 border-green-500/50 bg-green-500/5">
```

### Glassmorphism (for overlays)

```tsx
// Sticky header blur
<header className="backdrop-blur-lg bg-background/80 border-b">

// Bottom action bar
<div className="backdrop-blur-lg bg-background/90 border-t">
```

