## Card Patterns

### Exercise Card (Grid View)

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ┌────────┐                              │
│  │        │  Exercise Name          ⓘ   │
│  │  IMG   │  8 reps • 55kg              │
│  │ (80px) │  Sets: 0/6                  │
│  └────────┘                              │
│  [███████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░]   │
│  ───────────────────────────────────     │
│  [Muscle Badge]           [−] [+] [✓✓]   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Structure:**
- Container: `Card` with `rounded-2xl border-0 shadow-sm p-4`
- Image: 80px square, `rounded-xl bg-muted overflow-hidden`
- Title: `text-lg font-bold tracking-tight`
- Subtitle: `text-sm text-muted-foreground` ("8 reps • 55kg")
- Sets counter: `text-base font-semibold` ("Sets: 0/6")
- Progress bar: `h-2 rounded-full`, track `bg-muted`, fill with gradient
- Separator: `bg-border/50` (subtle)
- Footer: muscle badge left, action buttons right
- **Interaction**: `active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-100`

### Exercise Card (List View)

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ [IMG]  Exercise Name           [−] [+]   │
│ (48px) 0/6 sets                          │
│        [██████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░]   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Structure:**
- Container: `Card` with `rounded-lg p-3`
- Image: 48px square, `rounded-md`
- Title: `text-base font-semibold`
- Subtitle: `text-sm text-muted-foreground` ("0/6 sets")
- Smaller action buttons (36px)

### Plan Card

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Plan Name                    [Active]   │
│  12 weeks • 8 exercises                  │
│                                          │
│  [Manage]              [Set Active] [⋮]  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Structure:**
- Container: `Card` with `rounded-xl p-4`
- Title: `text-lg font-semibold`
- Badge: `Badge` for "Active" status (top-right or after title)
- Actions: bottom row with buttons

## Action Buttons

**Large, satisfying buttons that feel great to tap in the gym.**

### Set Action Buttons

```tsx
// Minus button (decrement) - subtle, secondary
<Button 
  variant="outline" 
  className="h-12 w-12 rounded-full p-0 border-2 text-muted-foreground
    active:scale-90 transition-transform duration-100"
>
  <Minus className="h-5 w-5" />
</Button>

// Plus button (increment) - primary action, vibrant
<Button 
  className="h-12 w-12 rounded-full p-0 
    bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary/80 
    text-primary-foreground shadow-lg shadow-primary/25
    active:scale-90 active:shadow-md transition-all duration-100"
>
  <Plus className="h-6 w-6" />
</Button>

// Done button (mark complete) - success, celebratory
<Button 
  className="h-12 w-12 rounded-full p-0 
    bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-600 
    text-white shadow-lg shadow-green-500/30
    active:scale-90 transition-all duration-100"
>
  <CheckCheck className="h-6 w-6" />
</Button>

// Already complete - muted success state
<Button 
  variant="outline"
  className="h-12 w-12 rounded-full p-0 
    text-green-500 border-2 border-green-500/50 bg-green-500/10"
  disabled
>
  <CheckCheck className="h-5 w-5" />
</Button>
```

