## Native Mobile Patterns

**Make it feel like a native iOS/Android app, not a web page.**

### Bottom Sheets (prefer over centered modals on mobile)

```tsx
// Use Sheet for mobile-friendly modals
<Sheet>
  <SheetContent side="bottom" className="rounded-t-3xl">
    <div className="mx-auto w-12 h-1.5 bg-muted rounded-full mb-6" /> {/* Drag handle */}
    <SheetHeader>
      <SheetTitle>Exercise Details</SheetTitle>
    </SheetHeader>
    {/* Content */}
  </SheetContent>
</Sheet>
```

### Swipe Actions (for lists)

```tsx
// Swipe to reveal delete/edit actions
<SwipeableRow
  leftAction={<Edit />}
  rightAction={<Trash className="text-destructive" />}
  onSwipeLeft={handleEdit}
  onSwipeRight={handleDelete}
>
  <ExerciseListItem />
</SwipeableRow>
```

### Pull-to-Refresh

```tsx
// Native-feel refresh
<PullToRefresh onRefresh={refetch}>
  <ExerciseList />
</PullToRefresh>
```

### iOS-Style Segmented Control (for tabs)

```tsx
// Instead of underline tabs, use pill-style
<div className="bg-muted p-1 rounded-xl">
