## Feedback

| Action | Feedback |
|--------|----------|
| Create success | Toast with success message |
| Update success | Silent (optimistic UI) or subtle toast |
| Delete success | Toast with "Undo" action (5s timeout) |
| API error | Toast with error message |
| Validation error | Inline under field (`text-destructive`) |

