## Gamification & Celebrations

**Make progress feel rewarding. Fitness apps should motivate!**

### Set Completion Feedback

```tsx
// Visual feedback when completing a set
const onSetComplete = () => {
  triggerHaptic('success');
  // Brief green flash on the card
  setFlashGreen(true);
  setTimeout(() => setFlashGreen(false), 300);
};
```

### Exercise Completion

```tsx
