```

### Selection Mode (Phase 2)

When cards are selected:
- Selected card: `ring-2 ring-primary bg-primary/5`
- SelectionBar appears (sticky bottom):

```tsx
<div className="fixed bottom-16 inset-x-4 z-40">
  <Button 
    className="w-full h-12 rounded-full bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white"
    onClick={startWorkout}
  >
    <Zap className="mr-2 h-5 w-5" />
    Start Workout ({selectedCount} Exercises)
  </Button>
</div>
```

