## Mobile-First Checklist

**Before shipping any UI, verify:**

### Touch & Interaction
- [ ] All buttons ≥ 44px tap target
- [ ] Press states on all interactive elements (`active:scale-[0.97]`)
- [ ] Haptic feedback on important actions
- [ ] Swipe gestures where appropriate

### Visual Polish
- [ ] Cards have subtle shadows (`shadow-sm`)
- [ ] Gradients on primary buttons
- [ ] Smooth transitions (150-300ms)
- [ ] Loading skeletons (no spinners)

### Native Feel
- [ ] Bottom sheets for mobile modals
- [ ] iOS safe area insets
- [ ] Pull-to-refresh where needed
- [ ] Backdrop blur on overlays

### Gamification
- [ ] Celebration on completion (100%)
- [ ] Progress milestones feedback
- [ ] Motivational messages
- [ ] Green highlights for success states

### Performance
- [ ] Animations use `transform` (GPU accelerated)
- [ ] No layout shifts during loading
- [ ] Optimistic UI updates
- [ ] Staggered list animations

