## Quick Design Decisions

| Question | Answer |
|----------|--------|
| Modal on mobile? | Use bottom Sheet, not centered Dialog |
| Loading indicator? | Skeleton, never spinner |
| Delete action? | Swipe or destructive button with confirmation |
| Progress feedback? | Animated bar + percentage + message |
| Button pressed? | Scale down 3% + reduce shadow |
| Success state? | Green gradient + haptic + brief animation |
| Empty state? | Icon + title + subtitle + CTA button |
